.TH QUIPU-COMPOSE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-compose \- Compose verified packs into a named inspection dataset
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu compose\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-shapes\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-destination\fR] [\fB\-\-revoke\-tombstone\fR] [\fB\-\-pack\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-reason\fR] [\fB\-\-use\-pointer\fR] [\fB\-\-declaration\fR] [\fB\-\-authority\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\-remote\fR] [\fB\-\-pointer\-cache\fR] [\fB\-\-rollback\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIpack\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compose verified packs into a named inspection dataset
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-shapes\-from\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-destination\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-revoke\-tombstone\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-pack\-key\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-reason\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-use\-pointer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-declaration\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-authority\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-repo\-remote\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-pointer\-cache\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-rollback\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIpack\fR]

